    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d106">

                <pb facs="0231" n="113" sameAs="frus:frus1929v03/pg113"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">868.76/18: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Greece</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Goold</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Extract]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Athens</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1929-05-28T17:00:00+02:00">May 28, 1929—5
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received May 28—3:42 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>40. My 38, May 21, 1 p.m.<anchor n="32" xml:id="d106-f1"/> This morning’s papers
                    announcing signature of the contract yesterday, I saw the Minister of
                    Communications who confirmed it. Upon my expressing my regret that Durham had
                    not been given an opportunity to make his explanations before the committee,
                    Minister replied that nothing that Durham could have said could have influenced
                    the result.</p>
                <pb facs="0232" n="114" xml:id="pg114"/>
                <p>I believe that considerations other than technical have been decisive. Mr.
                    Venizelos by the mere expression of his wish could have secured the necessary
                    hearing for Mr. Durham. It may be that he wants to give this contract to a
                    British firm by way of showing that he is not actuated by anti-British sentiment
                    as he has often been lately accused of being.</p>
                <p rendition="#center">. . . . . . .</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Goold</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
